160 0 obj
<<
/Type /StructElem
/S /P
/P 63 0 R
/E ( The principal evidence is retained in docs/WEEK5.md, docs/WEEK6.md, and docs/WEEK7.md, supported by the automated tests. freshness.test.mjs covers the distinction between a recent download and an old session. research.test.mjs covers constraint feasibility and deterministic simulation. Financial and attribution tests protect the reconciliation conditions, while the Python tests cover provider, API, search, and classification behavior.)
/Pg 17 0 R
/K [4]
>>
endobj
161 0 obj
<<
/Type /StructElem
/S /P
/P 63 0 R
/E ( The quality process changed the product in visible ways. Errors became specific to the invalid condition; stale outputs were cleared; fallback and freshness information became explicit; optimizer convergence was disclosed; and simulation carried an interpretation boundary. These outcomes demonstrate that testing was not performed only after development. Acceptance criteria affected the design and implementation of the final product.)
/Pg 17 0 R
/K [5]
>>
endobj
